                <mxCell id="fw" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f3f0;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;arcSize=5;" value="&lt;b&gt;fw-vpn&lt;/b&gt; · 10.0.0.20 (IP fija) · B2ats_v2&lt;hr&gt;• OpenVPN ×4: UDP 1194–1197 (login LDAP, IP por grupo)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;④ nftables revisa la ACL&lt;/b&gt; (forward, política DROP)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#2e7d32&#39;&gt;DNAT: 80/443 → srv-web 10.0.0.4&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• NAT (masquerade) hacia Internet&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;BIND9: zona interna terranova.local&lt;/b&gt; (DNS 53)&lt;br&gt;• chrony: servidor NTP de la red&lt;br&gt;• SNMPv3 (agente)&lt;br&gt;• IP forwarding (Linux + NIC de Azure)&lt;br&gt;• Hardening: input DROP, SSH solo admin y TI, sin root" vertex="1">
